ent-OrbitraRatvarLever = brass lever
    .desc = A lever with fine brass linkages.
ent-OrbitraRatvarPlate = pressure plate
    .desc = An almost invisible brass plate.
ent-OrbitraRatvarDelay = brass timer
    .desc = Half a second measured by tiny gears.
ent-OrbitraRatvarSkewer = brass skewer
    .desc = Sharp spikes concealed beneath a brass plate.
ent-OrbitraRatvarFlipper = brass flipper
    .desc = A spring-loaded plate with a powerful brass mechanism.
orbitra-ratvar-trap-wiring = Output links: { $count }. Touch the source and then a receiver with your tablet. Repeating a link removes it. Selecting the source again cancels linking.
orbitra-ratvar-trap-selected = Source selected. Touch a receiver with your tablet.
orbitra-ratvar-trap-linked = Connection toggled.
orbitra-ratvar-trap-link-cancelled = Linking cancelled.
orbitra-ratvar-trap-link-invalid = Requires a receiver of your cult on the same grid within 16 tiles. Cycles and more than eight outputs are forbidden.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-lever = Brass lever
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-lever-desc = Creates a signal source. Anyone can pull it; use a tablet to configure links.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-plate = Pressure plate
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-plate-desc = Detects living grounded creatures except members of its own cult. Activates linked traps and a trap on the same tile.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-delay = Brass timer
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-delay-desc = Forwards a signal after half a second. Ignores additional signals while waiting.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-skewer = Brass skewer
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-skewer-desc = Impales and damages creatures, including allies. Escape takes five seconds. Another signal retracts it. Ten-second cooldown.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-flipper = Brass flipper
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-flipper-desc = Throws unanchored objects six tiles in its facing direction. Twenty-second cooldown. Requires transmission coverage and energy.
